Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:20:58 +0100
Subject: Adjust the curl tests to libcurl 8.14

Newer libcurl words the "No URL set" and "protocol not supported" errors
differently, rejects a URL scheme that starts with a digit, limits the
lifetime of cookies and returns the scheme in lower case. Backport of
upstream commits 722e9b9fa57 (PHP 8.0.20), 3af76b2302c, 36d46a47321 and
25c09939029 (PHP 8.1).
---
 ext/curl/tests/bug77946.phpt       | 2 +-
 ext/curl/tests/curl_basic_007.phpt | 2 +-
 ext/curl/tests/curl_basic_009.phpt | 3 ++-
 ext/curl/tests/curl_basic_022.phpt | 6 +++---
 ext/curl/tests/curl_basic_024.phpt | 4 ++--
 5 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

